  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace and Stabilisation Programme - delegated cooperation with Denmark</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the programme is to contribute to peace and stability in the Sahel region.
In line with the Danish Sahel Initiative, the programme aims at contributing to 1) enhanced mediation and conflict resolution, 2) improved security and 3) counter violent extremism og organised crime.
The programme is a joint donor funded programme and in line with priorities from the UN, AU and EU for the region.</narrative>
  </description>
